hnote over WT #Lavender:  ordered_peer_tx_approvals := Collection<peer_i_tx_approval_signed_by_boomlet_i> [0 \n <= i <= 4] sorted in active setup peer order by peer_ids_collection \n ordered_non_initiator_peer_tx_approvals := ordered_peer_tx_approvals with the initiator's approval omitted
hnote over WT #Pink:  Assert count(ordered_peer_tx_approvals) == count(peer_ids_collection) \n Assert ordered_peer_tx_approvals contains exactly one approval per active setup peer \n Assert ordered_peer_tx_approvals has no missing peers and no duplicate signers

